.TH "TIMEW\-EXTENSIONS" "1" "2025-08-16" "timew 1.9.1" "User Manuals"
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el       .ds Aq '
.ss \n[.ss] 0
.nh
.ad l
.de URL
\fI\\$2\fP <\\$1>\\$3
..
.als MTO URL
.if \n[.g] \{\
.  mso www.tmac
.  am URL
.    ad l
.  .
.  am MTO
.    ad l
.  .
.  LINKSTYLE blue R < >
.\}
.SH "نام (NAME)"
timew-extensions \- list available extensions
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
.nf
\fBtimew extensions\fP
.fi
.br
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
Displays the directory containing the extension programs and a table showing each extension and its status.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.sp
\fBtimew\-diagnostics\fP(1)